00:41:11.845 --> 00:41:13.513
- Shut the fuck up.
- What are you doing?


00:41:13.805 --> 00:41:15.140
Who... Who are you?


00:41:15.432 --> 00:41:16.516
- Hi.
- That's Marta.


00:41:16.808 --> 00:41:18.351
I'm Marta.


00:41:18.643 --> 00:41:20.020
You have an accent.
Where are you from?
The south?


00:41:20.312 --> 00:41:21.855
- Oh, my God.
- Are you from Umbria?


00:41:22.147 --> 00:41:24.274
No. What's she talking about?


00:41:24.566 --> 00:41:25.692
- I sound just like you.
- No. She's from here.


00:41:25.984 --> 00:41:26.943
- You're not from Gartagnana.
- Yes, she is.


00:41:27.235 --> 00:41:28.528
You do not sound like you're
from Gartagnana.


00:41:28.820 --> 00:41:30.155
Are you drinking
the sacramental wine?


00:41:30.447 --> 00:41:31.948
- Yes.
- No.


00:41:32.449 --> 00:41:34.201
- Father Tommasso
drinks it all the time.
- I'm gonna tell Mother Marea.


00:41:34.659 --> 00:41:35.243
I'm gonna tell Mother Marea.


00:41:35.535 --> 00:41:36.203
Why are you always
telling on people?


00:41:36.578 --> 00:41:37.204
Why are you choking me?


00:41:37.996 --> 00:41:38.830
Yeah, shut up.
Just drink a little bit of it.


00:41:39.122 --> 00:41:40.248
Sister Alessandra wants you
to drink.


00:41:40.999 --> 00:41:41.708
Ginevra, it's fine.


00:41:42.042 --> 00:41:44.794
Nothing matters in life.
We're all gonna die.


00:41:45.086 --> 00:41:46.463
Terrible things are happening
all the time.


00:41:46.755 --> 00:41:47.839
