01:10:18.548 --> 01:10:19.507
Yes! Stop. Stop.


01:10:19.799 --> 01:10:21.968
Sister Marea!
Sister Marea! Wake up!


01:10:22.260 --> 01:10:24.179
I'm not a Jew. I'm not a Jew.


