through those doors!


01:11:28.618 --> 01:11:31.871
Being a busybody,
filthy conversation...


01:11:32.163 --> 01:11:34.833
Vain jangling, drinking...


01:11:35.125 --> 01:11:36.418
Eating blood.


01:11:41.381 --> 01:11:43.383
