01:11:59.566 --> 01:12:01.192
That's the longest list
I've ever had...


01:12:01.484 --> 01:12:02.402
For sins.


01:12:03.236 --> 01:12:05.113
Please have mercy on me.


01:12:05.405 --> 01:12:06.364
For your punishment,


01:12:06.656 --> 01:12:08.074
