01:12:52.869 --> 01:12:56.039
For me, I'm embarrassed.
How do you think he's gonna
feel when he knows this?


01:12:56.331 --> 01:12:57.499
Please don't tell my father.


01:12:57.874 --> 01:12:59.793
- There's no need
to tell my father.
- He's a patron of the church,


01:13:00.126 --> 01:13:00.960
